INSERT INTO public.email_drafts (id, sales_id, customer_id, rule_id, subject, body, status, created_at, approved_at, channel) VALUES (1, 1, 4, NULL, '<think>**Crafting a professional email**', 'I need to compose an email in a precise JSON format, keeping the body under 150 words and professional. I should naturally mention that the lease ends on June 30, 2026, and express happiness while being open to leasing. I’m considering referencing 1-2 car options, like the Tiguan and the Jetta, keeping in mind that she owns a Tucson, making the Tiguan relevant. It would also be good to mention the Jetta if she’s interested in something more compact. I’ll need to ensure that I escape newlines properly for the JSON format.</think>

{"subject":"Priya, a couple of options to consider before your Tucson lease ends","body":"Hi Priya,\n\nI hope you’re doing well. I see your 2020 Hyundai Tucson lease runs through June 30, 2026, and since you’ve been happy with it but are open to leasing again, I wanted to share a couple of options that may be worth considering.\n\nIf you’d like to stay with a similar SUV feel, the 2025 Volkswagen Tiguan S at $29,495 is a great fit. If you’re open to something more compact and budget-friendly, the 2025 Volkswagen Jetta S at $21,990 is also a strong option.\n\nIf either stands out, I’d be happy to send more details or set up a time for you to take a look.\n\nBest regards,"}', 'dismissed', '2026-06-08 13:20:49.865208+00', NULL, 'email');
INSERT INTO public.email_drafts (id, sales_id, customer_id, rule_id, subject, body, status, created_at, approved_at, channel) VALUES (2, 1, 4, NULL, 'Priya, options to consider for your Tucson lease', 'Hi Priya,

I wanted to reach out regarding your 2020 Hyundai Tucson lease, which ends on June 30, 2026. Since you mentioned you’re happy with the Tucson but open to leasing again, I thought I’d share a couple of options that may be a good fit.

If you’d like to stay with a similar SUV, the 2025 Volkswagen Tiguan S at $29,495 offers updated features and a comfortable, practical ride. If you’re open to something more budget-friendly, the 2025 Volkswagen Jetta S at $21,990 is also a great value.

If either one interests you, I’d be happy to send more details or put together some lease options.

Best regards,', 'dismissed', '2026-06-08 13:23:56.887372+00', NULL, 'email');
INSERT INTO public.email_drafts (id, sales_id, customer_id, rule_id, subject, body, status, created_at, approved_at, channel) VALUES (9, 1, 4, NULL, 'Your 2020 Hyundai Tucson Lease Options for June 2026', 'Hi Priya,

I hope you and your family are doing well. It is hard to believe how quickly time passes, and I wanted to reach out regarding your 2020 Hyundai Tucson lease, which is scheduled to mature on June 30, 2026.

The good news is that there is still plenty of time, and we can make the lease-end process smooth and easy. I also took a look for similar compact or family-friendly SUV options, keeping your current Tucson in mind.

Lease-End Options

Return Your Tucson
When your lease comes due, we can help guide you through the return process and make sure everything is as seamless as possible.

Lease or Finance Your Next Vehicle
At the moment, we do not currently have a close match in stock to your 2020 Hyundai Tucson in the compact or family-friendly SUV range. We do have a 2025 Volkswagen Tiguan S available, which may be worth considering, but I know the right fit matters for your family and daily routine.

Review Your Next Step Early
If you are happy with leasing but open to what comes next, I would be glad to help review your options ahead of time and keep you updated as similar SUV inventory changes.

If you would like, simply reply and let me know what you are hoping for in your next vehicle, and I can help point you toward the best path forward. I would also be happy to set up a quick, no-pressure conversation to review your lease-end options.

Thank you again, Priya. We appreciate the opportunity to help your family navigate the next steps.

Warm regards,

[Your Name] | Sales Representative', 'dismissed', '2026-06-11 13:10:47.86769+00', NULL, 'email');
INSERT INTO public.email_drafts (id, sales_id, customer_id, rule_id, subject, body, status, created_at, approved_at, channel) VALUES (3, 1, 4, NULL, 'Priya, a smooth option to explore before your Tucson lease ends', 'Hi Priya,

I hope you are doing well. Since you have been enjoying your 2020 Hyundai Tucson and are open to leasing again, I just wanted to reach out as your lease approaches its June 2026 end date.

If you would like to start comparing options early, the 2025 Volkswagen Tiguan S could be a very comfortable next step, with updated technology, safety features, and the versatility many Tucson drivers appreciate. If a smaller vehicle is also of interest, the 2025 Volkswagen Golf Base is another practical option to review.

I would be happy to help you compare payments and timing whenever it feels convenient. Please let me know if you have any questions.

Best regards,
Sales Team', 'dismissed', '2026-06-08 13:47:17.576932+00', NULL, 'email');
INSERT INTO public.email_drafts (id, sales_id, customer_id, rule_id, subject, body, status, created_at, approved_at, channel) VALUES (4, 1, 4, NULL, 'A couple of options to consider for your 2020 Hyundai Tucson', 'Hi Priya,

I hope you are doing well. Since you have been happy with your 2020 Hyundai Tucson and are open to leasing again, I just wanted to reach out with a couple of options that may be worth a look as your lease approaches its June 30, 2026 end date.

If you would like to stay with a comfortable SUV, the 2025 Volkswagen Tiguan S is a great fit with updated technology and safety features. If you are also open to something more payment-friendly, the 2025 Volkswagen Jetta S could be a very good value.

I would be happy to help you review and compare both whenever it is convenient for you. Please let me know if you have any questions.

