INSERT INTO public.email_drafts (id, sales_id, customer_id, rule_id, subject, body, status, created_at, approved_at, channel) VALUES (8, 1, 4, NULL, 'Priya, planning ahead for your 2020 Hyundai Tucson lease', 'Hi Priya,

I hope you and your family are doing well.

It is hard to believe how quickly time passes, and I wanted to reach out regarding your 2020 Hyundai Tucson lease, which is set to mature on June 30, 2026.

The good news is there is still plenty of time to review your options and make the next step feel smooth and convenient around your work schedule.

Your Options

1. You can lease again and move into something newer with updated features and a fresh warranty.

2. You can review a purchase option if you would prefer to keep your current Tucson.

3. You can upgrade to something that may suit your family’s needs a little differently as things change.

For example, the 2025 Volkswagen Tiguan S could be a great fit if you would like to stay with a practical SUV for two growing kids and everyday driving. If you are also open to something more commuter-friendly, the 2025 Volkswagen Jetta S is an excellent value and easy on daily driving.

Next Steps

If you would like, I can help you compare payments, review lease-end timing, and outline what each option would look like so everything is clear and easy.

We can do this by reply, over the phone, or during a quick visit at a time that works for you.

Thank you again for your continued relationship with us, Priya. I appreciate the opportunity to assist and make this transition as simple as possible.

Warm regards,
[Your Name]
Sales Representative', 'approved', '2026-06-10 18:50:43.31181+00', '2026-06-10 19:04:55.760731+00', 'email');
INSERT INTO public.email_drafts (id, sales_id, customer_id, rule_id, subject, body, status, created_at, approved_at, channel) VALUES (5, 1, 4, NULL, 'Priya, planning ahead for your 2020 Hyundai Tucson lease', 'Hi Priya,

I hope you and your family are doing well. I wanted to reach out early regarding your 2020 Hyundai Tucson lease ending on June 30, 2026, so the next steps can feel smooth and seamless with no pressure.

