1. 2025 Volkswagen Tiguan S - a practical step up in space for family life.
2. 2025 Volkswagen Jetta S - a comfortable, efficient choice if keeping commuting costs in check is the priority.

You may be perfectly happy in the Tucson for now, and I completely understand. When the time is right, we are here to help review lease options and make the process easy.

Thank you, Priya. I look forward to helping whenever you''re ready.

Warm regards,', 'dismissed', '2026-06-08 14:02:03.056696+00', NULL, 'email');
INSERT INTO public.email_drafts (id, sales_id, customer_id, rule_id, subject, body, status, created_at, approved_at, channel) VALUES (6, 1, 4, NULL, 'Planning ahead for your 2020 Hyundai Tucson lease', 'Hi Priya,

I hope you and your family are doing well.

I wanted to reach out about your 2020 Hyundai Tucson lease, which matures on June 30, 2026. There is still time, and I am happy to help make the process simple and easy to navigate.

Your options are straightforward.

1. If you would like to stay in a family-friendly SUV, the 2025 Volkswagen Tiguan S could be a nice fit for two kids and everyday comfort.

