• Purchase: Keep your current Tiguan and enjoy ownership with full control.
• Return: Return the vehicle with no fees and start fresh — we’ll help you plan.

Please reply directly to this email or call us at (902) 225-9368 to schedule a convenient time for you to drop by.

Warm regards,
Wilson Xing | Sales Consultant', 'dismissed', '2026-06-13 16:56:30.16259+00', NULL, 'email');
INSERT INTO public.email_drafts (id, sales_id, customer_id, rule_id, subject, body, status, created_at, approved_at, channel) VALUES (35, 1, 16, 4, 'Brianna, Your 2022 Volkswagen Tiguan Lease Options', 'Hi Brianna,

I hope this email finds you well.

Can you believe how quickly time flies? We want to remind you that the lease on your 2022 Volkswagen Tiguan is scheduled to mature on September 16, 2026.

We know you’ve got a lot going on, and we’re ready to walk you through your options without any pressure. Whether you’re looking to upgrade, keep your ride, or return it — we’ve got you covered.

Your End-of-Lease Options:
Option 1: Upgrade to a new model. Get behind the wheel of a brand-new vehicle with the latest technology, safety features, and a fresh warranty.
Option 2: Purchase your current vehicle. If you''ve fallen in love with your 2022 Volkswagen Tiguan, you can buy it out for the residual value listed in your contract.
Option 3: Return the vehicle. Simply schedule an inspection and return the keys to us at the end of your term.

Let''s Find the Best Path Forward
We would love to invite you back into the dealership for a quick, no-pressure chat to review these options and see what fits best for you.

Please reply directly to this email or call us at (902) 225-9368 to schedule a convenient time for you to drop by.

Thank you so much for being a valued part of the O''Regan''s VW family. We look forward to assisting you with your next automotive chapter.

Warm regards,
Wilson Xing | Sales Consultant', 'pending', '2026-06-13 17:12:13.654389+00', NULL, 'email');


