levant fields; don''t dump raw rows verbatim.\n- Do not show the SQL you ran unless the user explicitly asks for it.\n- If a query returns nothing, say so plainly and suggest what to check."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi! Ask me anything about your CRM data.\n\nExamples:\n\u2022 \"How many customers haven''t been contacted in 60 days?\"\n\u2022 \"Which leases end in the next 3 months?\"\n\u2022 \"What Toyotas do we have in stock under $30k?\""}, {"role": "user", "content": "any customer''s lease or finance ending soon?"}], "tools": [{"type": "function", "function": {"name": "query_db", "description": "Run a single read-only SQL SELECT statement against the CRM database and get the matching rows back. Use this whenever the user asks about their customers, cars, interactions, inventory, outreach rules, or email drafts.", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {"sql": {"type": "string", "description": "One SELECT statement in PostgreSQL dialect. No INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE/DDL."}}, "required": ["sql"]}}}], "tool_choice": "auto"}', '{"choices": [{"finish_reason": "tool_calls", "index": 0, "message": {"content": null, "role": "assistant", "tool_calls": [{"function": {"arguments": "{\"sql\":\"SELECT c.full_name, c.email, c.phone, cc.make, cc.model, cc.year, cc.ownership_type, cc.lease_end_date\\nFROM customer_car cc\\nJOIN customers c ON c.id = cc.customer_id\\nWHERE cc.ownership_type IN (''lease'',''finance'')\\n  AND cc.lease_end_date IS NOT NULL\\n  AND cc.lease_end_date >= CURRENT_DATE\\n  AND cc.lease_end_date <= CURRENT_DATE + INTERVAL ''90 days''\\nORDER BY cc.lease_end_date ASC, c.full_name\\nLIMIT 50;\"}", "name": "query_db"}, "id": "call_Mq7Wb4Zcs0gZ3GExKiCWur0p", "index": 0, "type": "function"}]}}], "created": 1781181972, "id": "chatcmpl-643202dd-6443-4079-be4d-60005", "model": "gpt-5.4", "object": "chat.completion", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 134, "prompt_tokens": 629, "total_tokens": 763}}', '2026-06-11 12:46:12.505067+00');
