levant fields; don''t dump raw rows verbatim.\n- Do not show the SQL you ran unless the user explicitly asks for it.\n- If a query returns nothing, say so plainly and suggest what to check."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi! Ask me anything about your CRM data.\n\nExamples:\n\u2022 \"How many customers haven''t been contacted in 60 days?\"\n\u2022 \"Which leases end in the next 3 months?\"\n\u2022 \"What Toyotas do we have in stock under $30k?\""}, {"role": "user", "content": "any customer''s lease or finance ending soon?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Yes \u2014 1 customer has a lease/finance ending in the next 90 days.\n\n- Priya Sharma\n  - Vehicle: 2020 Hyundai Tucson\n  - Type: lease\n  - End date: 2026-06-30\n  - Email: priya.sharma@hotmail.com\n  - Phone: 604-555-0104\n\nIf you want, I can also check a wider window like 6 months or break it out by lease vs finance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "which inventory car might fit her?"}, {"content": null, "role": "assistant", "tool_calls": [{"function": {"arguments": "{\"sql\":\"SELECT c.full_name, cc.make AS current_make, cc.model AS current_model, cc.year AS current_year, i.id, i.make, i.model, i.year, i.trim, i.mileage, i.price, i.status, i.features, i.notes\\nFROM customers c\\nJOIN customer_car cc ON cc.customer_id = c.id\\nJOIN inventory i ON i.status = ''available''\\nWHERE c.full_name = ''Priya Sharma''\\n  AND cc.ownership_type IN (''lease'',''finance'')\\n  AND cc.lease_end_date = DATE ''2026-06-30''\\n  AND (\\n    (i.make = cc.make AND i.model = cc.model)\\n    OR (i.make = cc.make)\\n    OR (cc.make = ''Hyundai'' AND i.make IN (''Hyundai'',''Kia''))\\n  )\\nORDER BY\\n  CASE\\n    WHEN i.make = cc.make AND i.model = cc.model THEN 1\\n    WHEN i.make = cc.make THEN 2\\n    ELSE 3\\n  END,\\n  ABS(i.year - cc.year),\\n  i.price ASC\\nLIMIT 10;\"}", "name": "query_db"}, "id": "call_5pPGgkCIPLtdWbg2Ik2KIG1Y", "index": 0, "type": "function"}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call_5pPGgkCIPL