Pricing/Financials:*\n        *   Base Price: $42,600\n        *   Options Adjustment: $3,000 (This is listed under \"Options\")\n        *   Selling Price: $45,600\n        *   Discount: $1,500 (Listed under \"Discount\")\n        *   Fees Total: $3,500 (This is the sum of various fees)\n        *   Tax Total: $5,800\n        *   Capital Cost: $45,600\n        *   Total with Tax: $51,400\n        *   Cash Down: $10,000\n        *   Trade Equity: $0 (No trade listed)\n        *   Cap Reduction: $0\n        *   Drive Off Total: $41,400\n    *   *Lease Specifics:*\n        *   Lender: (Not explicitly named, but the deal is a lease)\n        *   Rate/Term: (Not explicitly listed in the visible summary, but the deal type is Lease)\n        *   Residual/Buy Option: (Not listed)\n    *   *Line Items:* I need to list all fees/discounts with categories.\n        *   Discount: $1,500 (Category: discount)\n        *   Fees: (Need to break down the $3,500 total if possible, but the image only shows the total. I will list the total fees if individual items aren''t clear, or list the major components if they are.)\n            *   Sales Tax: $5,800 (Wait, this is listed as a total, not a line item fee. I''ll treat the $3,500 as the sum of various fees.)\n            *   Let''s look at the line items section:\n                *   Sales Tax: $5,800 (This is the tax total, not a line item fee in the same way)\n                *   Fees: $3,500 (I will list this as a single ''other'' item if I cannot break it down, or list the components if they are visible.)\n                *   *Self-Correction:* The prompt asks to copy *every* fee/discount line verbatim. I see \"Sales Tax\" ($5,800), \"Fees\" ($3,500), and \"Discount\" ($1,500).\n                *   Line Items:\n                    1. Discount: $1,500 (Category: discount)\n                    2. Fees: $3,500 (Category: other)\n                    3. Sales Tax: $5,800 (Category: gov_levy)\n    *   *Trades:* None listed.\n    *   *Customer:*\n        *   Name: Briana C.\n        *   Phone: (902) 555-1234\n        *   Email: brianac@email.com\n    *   *Confidence:* High, as most data is clearly visible.\n\n3.  **Structure the JSON (Applying Rules):**\n\n    *   `deal_type`: \"lease\"\n    *   `contract_date`: \"2022-08-08\"\n    *   `delivery_date`: null (Not found)\n    *   `first_payment_date`: null (Not found)\n    *   `dealership`: \"O''Regan''s Volkswagen Halifax\"\n    *   `rep_name_raw`: \"Quinn West\"\n    *   `make`: \"Volkswagen\"\n    *   `model`: \"Tiguan\"\n    *   `model_year`: 2022\n    *   `trim_base`: \"Comfortline\"\n    *   `trim_package`: null (No package listed)\n    *   `model_code`: null (Not explicitly listed)\n    *   `vin`: \"4J8A...\" (I will use the visible portion if possible, but since it''s truncated, I''ll use null or the visible string if it looks like a full VIN. It looks like a partial VIN, so I''ll use null for safety.)\n    *   `stock_number`: null\n    *   `condition`: \"new\"\n    *   `odometer_at_deal`: null\n    *   `exterior_color`: \"White\"\n    *   `engine`: \"2.0L Turbo\"\n    *   `transmission`: \"Automatic\"\n    *   `drivetrain`: \"AWD\"\n    *   `base_price`: 42600\n    *   `options_adjustment`: 3000\n    *   `selling_price`: 45600\n    *   `discount`: -1500 (Rule 3: Discounts are negative)\n    *   `fees_total`: 3500\n    *   `tax_total`: 5800\n    *   `capital_cost`: 45600\n    *   `total_with_tax`: 51400\n    *   `cash_down`: 10000\n    *   `trade_equity`: 0\n    *   `cap_reduction`: 0\n    *   `drive_off_total`: 41400\n    *   `lender`: null\n    *   `rate_pct`: null\n    *   `term_months`: null\n    *   `payment_frequency`: null\n*   *Lease fields:* All null (as per Rule 9)\n*   `line_items`:\n    *   {\"item_name\": \"Discount\", \"category\": \"discount\", \"amount\": -1500.00}\n    *   {\"item_name\": \"Fees\", \"category\": \"other\", \"amount\": 3500.00}\n    *   {\"item_name\": \"Sales Tax\", \"category\": \"gov_levy\", \"amount\": 58