ate\" -> rate_pct (NOT Residual %). Rate is usually 0\u201310, not hundreds.\n- \"KM Allowed\" / \"KPY Allowed\" -> km_per_year (e.g. 20000). \"Residual 47%\" -> residual_pct as 47.\n- \"Res. MSRP\" -> residual_msrp. \"Cash Down / Cap Reduction\" -> both cash_down and cap_reduction.\n"}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "image_url", "image_url": {"url": "<image omitted, 305415 chars>"}}, {"type": "text", "text": "Read ONLY the Lease or Finance table. Return ONLY the JSON object. Term and Number of Payments are separate rows."}]}], "max_tokens": 2048, "temperature": 0.0}', '{"choices": [{"finish_reason": "stop", "index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "{\n  \"deal_type\": \"lease\",\n  \"lender\": \"VW Credit Canada Inc.\",\n  \"rate_pct\": 5.99,\n  \"term\": 48,\n  \"payment_frequency\": \"biweekly\",\n  \"num_payments\": 104,\n  \"base_payment\": 220.25,\n  \"payment_amount\": 253.29,\n  \"capital_cost\": 44119.45,\n  \"cash_down\": 8781.75,\n  \"cap_reduction\": 8781.75,\n  \"drive_off_total\": 11000.00,\n  \"residual_msrp\": 40390.00,\n  \"residual_pct\": 47,\n  \"residual_value\": 18983.30,\n  \"buy_option_price\": 18983.30,\n  \"km_per_year\": 20000,\n  \"excess_km_rate\": 0.12,\n  \"security_deposit\": 550.00\n}"}}], "created": 1781366106, "model": "Qwen3VL-4B-Instruct-Q4_K_M.gguf", "system_fingerprint": "b9590-d2462f8f7", "object": "chat.completion", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 245, "prompt_tokens": 2625, "total_tokens": 2870, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}, "id": "chatcmpl-X5bdx6ZN7UaAr73xznVipVtIfYNcFcIk", "timings": {"cache_n": 0, "prompt_n": 2625, "prompt_ms": 12723.541, "prompt_per_token_ms": 4.847063238095238, "prompt_per_second": 206.31049170981572, "predicted_n": 245, "predicted_ms": 6394.271, "predicted_per_token_ms": 26.099065306122448, "predicted_per_second": 38.31554840262479}}', '2026-06-13 15:55:06.0822+00');
