pathy (acknowledging market research) $\\rightarrow$ value proposition (the incentive) $\\rightarrow$ soft CTA. The overall length is short to medium, maintaining a conversational pace. There are no lists or heavy formatting; the message relies on smooth transitions between paragraphs.\n\n### Style\nThe style is highly empathetic and casually professional. The writer actively validates the customer\u2019s process, acknowledging their need to \"invest\" and \"research,\" which reduces perceived sales pressure. The tone is encouraging and informative, using specific, strong data points (e.g., \"0.99% special finance rate,\" \"60 months\") to demonstrate expertise. The language is friendly and conversational, ending with a gentle wish for safe driving and a look forward to connecting."}]}', '{"choices": [{"finish_reason": "stop", "index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "{\n  \"subject\": \"Update Regarding Your 2022 VW Tiguan Lease\",\n  \"body\": \"Hi Brianna,\\n\\nI hope you\u2019re doing well! As your lease on the 2022 Volkswagen Tiguan ends September 16, 2026, I wanted to offer a few smooth upgrade options to help you transition seamlessly into a new vehicle. We\u2019ve got a few great models in our current inventory that could fit your needs and budget:\\n\\n1. 2025 Volkswagen Jetta S \u2014 $21,990\\n2. 2025 Volkswagen Golf Base \u2014 $25,990\\n3. 2025 Volkswagen Tiguan S \u2014 $29,495\\n\\nEach of these models offers a refreshed design, improved technology, and great value \u2014 and we\u2019re offering competitive terms to make the switch easier. I\u2019d be happy to walk you through what\u2019s available or help you decide which fits your lifestyle best.\\n\\nFeel free to reply or give me a call anytime \u2014 I\u2019m here to help you find the perfect next step.\\n\\nThanks for being a valued customer, and I look forward to helping you keep driving with confidence.\\n\\nWarm regards,\\nJamie Lee\\nSales Representative\\nRiverbend Automotive\"\n}"}}], "created": 1781366432, "model": "Qwen3VL-4B-Instruct-Q4_K_M.gguf", "system_fingerprint": "b9590-d2462f8f7", "object": "chat.completion", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 276, "prompt_tokens": 959, "total_tokens": 1235, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 323}}, "id": "chatcmpl-O6kofh1Gte1QfbaAkUVhdY96L5KFIrtA", "timings": {"cache_n": 323, "prompt_n": 636, "prompt_ms": 1652.155, "prompt_per_token_ms": 2.5977279874213837, "prompt_per_second": 384.95177510584665, "predicted_n": 276, "predicted_ms": 6874.082, "predicted_per_token_ms": 24.90609420289855, "predicted_per_second": 40.15081577438267}}', '2026-06-13 16:00:32.345844+00');
